ence and increasing website conversion rates through instant engagement.</span></p>\n","clientName":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Orient Financial Broker, a regulated financial services firm in the UAE.</span></p>\n","companyInfo":null,"keyBenefitsList":null,"projectCaseStudyFile":null,"technologyLogos":[{"altText":"RTA","mediaItemUrl":"https://wp.emqube.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/RTA-Logo-1x.webp"},{"altText":"WordPress","mediaItemUrl":"https://wp.emqube.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WordPress-1x.webp"},{"altText":"Google Vertex AI","mediaItemUrl":"https://wp.emqube.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Google-Vertex-AI-1x.webp"}],"testimonialAuthor":"Marketing Manager","testimonialContent":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The AI chatbot has significantly improved our website’s interactivity. It provides our visitors with accurate, instant information about our services, which has helped us capture more leads and engage potential clients effectively.</span></p>\n"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"cG9zdDo3NDAz"}},"staticQueryHashes":["3649515864"],"slicesMap":{"footer":"footer","navigation-bar":"navigation-bar"}}